  unitName: Red Axe Michele
  unitId: 10253
  unitNumber: 346
  description: The daughter of a prominent aristocrat from the La Veda Republic.
    She was unstoppable with her axe, but thanks to her overprotective upbringing
    she became quite self-centered. However, having recognized this herself as well,
    she came to extremely dislike getting involved with other people. Then one day
    she met a certain mechanical figure and her objective changed to battle. She
    would now face off against an evil force the likes of which had never been seen.
  summonDesc: How did 'you' summon me?<br>Whatever! If you don't keep me happy<br>I'll
    just go home!
  fusionDesc: Are you kidding me!?<br>I'm the only one you <br>should be strengthening!
